notes.content:
We've added support for up to 4 players! Also, a new Firing Range is now available — a carefree zone to have fun with no penalties.

Bug Fixes:  
— Fixed an issue with the store in single-player mode;

— Performed major network optimizations to prevent game crashes (if you were experiencing any);

— Adjusted Shadow Quality settings; 

— Fixed an issue where aiming in third-person view caused control issues (aiming is now disabled while in third-person mode);

— Fixed various other bugs!


Our Goal - 50 Reviews! 🤩
If you've been enjoying the game, we'd greatly appreciate a Steam review. It helps us out a ton!
A huge thank you to everyone who has already left a review! ❤️

Good luck with your work at B.A.N.K.!

We added hats!
— Added new screamers.    


Fixed bugs:  
— There were some problems with server connection, hopefully we've fixed them;

— Items no longer disappear in the elevator;

— Fixed a bug where it was impossible to exchange items for coins in single player; 

— Fixed some other bugs as well!


Happy working in B.A.N.K.!
